WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

4
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

5
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

6
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

7
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

8
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

9
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

10
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

11
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

12
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

13
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

14
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

15
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

16
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

17
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

18
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

19
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

20
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

21
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

22
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

23
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

24
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

25
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

26
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

27
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

28
00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:53.570
[LUFFY]
Gum-Gum Bazooka!

29
00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:54.880
[BUGGY yells]

30
00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:57.650
[CABAJI]
We have to retreat!

31
00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:00.690
[MOHJI]
We're doomed!
Run for your lives!

32
00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:04.960
[CROWD yells]

33
00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:08.910
Is everyone here?

34
00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:10.180
Okay, buddy check.

35
00:02:10.210 --> 00:02:12.580
Sound off if you think
you're missing yours.

36
00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:13.780
I'm here!

37
00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:15.050
Got mine.

38
00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.210
[PIRATE C]
Right here.

39
00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:17.880
Okay.

40
00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:19.920
[PIRATE E]
Captain Buggy
didn't make it back.

41
00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:22.550
He's not all here!

42
00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:28.500
<b>Present Day
An Island in the East Blue</b>

43
00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:28.430
[laughs]

44
00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:31.400
At last my flashy raft
is finished!

45
00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:37.200
[laughs]
I swear, I'll get you!

46
00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:40.720
<b>Captain Buggy
(Missing a Few Parts)</b>

47
00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:45.480
[yells]

48
00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:47.930
Bad luck just
makes me stronger!

49
00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:50.360
<b>The Adventures of Buggy's Crew</b>

50
00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:51.800
Bring it on!

51
00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.120
Lunch time!

52
00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:04.310
[shrieks]

53
00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:13.720
[BUGGY]
Chop Chop Harpoon!

54
00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:19.580
[shrieks]

55
00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:21.990
[chuckles]
Just accept it.

56
00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:23.810
Your time has come.

57
00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:25.340
[chuckles]

58
00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:30.390
[BIG BLUE BIRD grunts]

59
00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.210
[panting]

60
00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.410
[BUGGY]
He-heh.

61
00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:36.320
<b>A Big Bird</b>

62
00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.120
It was just a joke!

63
00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:37.350
[BUGGY]
Forgive me! Aaah!

64
00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.320
[yells]

65
00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:53.720
[BUGGY chuckles]

66
00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.870
[BUGGY]
Closer... closer.

67
00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:57.960
My plan is perfection.

68
00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:02.290
[BIG BLUE BIRD squawks]

69
00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:04.620
[BUGGY]
Stupid bird! Ha ha ha ha!

70
00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:10.010
[giggles]

71
00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:12.910
Ah-ha! I got you!
Oh crap. You got me.

72
00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:14.840
What the hell just happened?

73
00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:16.210
[screams]

74
00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:17.990
Oh no...

75
00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.300
- [YELLOW BIRD A, B grunt]
- [BUGGY] Ow. Ow. Ow. Ow.

76
00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:21.530
[BUGGY]
Stop it.

77
00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.730
The end is near...

78
00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:25.600
[coughing]

79
00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:42.430
Where am I?

80
00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:44.090
[rustling]

81
00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.490
[GAIMON]
You must leave!

82
00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:48.080
[BUGGY]
Says who?!

83
00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:50.910
If you want to live
you must leave.

84
00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.700
What are these things?

85
00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.060
[GAIMON]
These are
the animals of the forest.

86
00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:03.020
If you touch them,
you will be annihilated.

87
00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:05.780
Wow... These guys are flashy.

88
00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.820
It's okay...

89
00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.950
[GAIMON grunts]
I warned you
not to take another step.

90
00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:12.480
[gunshot]

91
00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:16.090
[BUGGY]
How dare you shoot at me?!

92
00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:17.280
[GAIMON]
Crap. I missed.

93
00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:19.680
[BUGGY]
Ah-ha! There you are!

94
00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:21.980
[GAIMON]
Uh! What the hell?

95
00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:24.620
You're mine!

96
00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.690
Now get out here.

97
00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:31.200
[GAIMON groans]
You have Devil Fruit Powers!

98
00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:32.820
So what if I do.

99
00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:36.730
You're just a...
uh... you're just a...

100
00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.230
What are you?

101
00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.530
Like a... a jack-in-the-box
or something?

102
00:05:45.450 --> 00:05:49.050
Yes, ironically I am
in a box and my name is...

103
00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:52.700
No, you idiot!
I'm a person not a toy!

104
00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:55.280
Also... I will kill you
if you go anywhere near

105
00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.820
my precious animals,
so watch it.

106
00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:00.050
I will not hesitate
to put you down.

107
00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:02.460
Oh... You wanna fight?

108
00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:06.560
I admire your stupidity
even if it gets you killed.

109
00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:08.290
[grunts]

110
00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:11.340
[BUGGY grunts]

111
00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.340
[GAIMON growls]

112
00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:16.400
[HIPPORILLA exhales]

113
00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:17.400
Gotcha!

114
00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:18.940
[GAIMON]
Damn you!

115
00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:24.280
That's no fair using weapons!

116
00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:27.190
[GAIMON]
Then what the hell
do you call this?

117
00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:29.070
[chuckles]

118
00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:31.370
[GAIMON]
Say your prayers,
and say them fast!

119
00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:32.830
[gunshots]

120
00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:43.610
[screams]

121
00:06:46.860 --> 00:06:49.230
Chop Chop Quick Escape!

122
00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.500
[screams]

123
00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:08.770
It's too bad for you,
but I can't allow anyone to live

124
00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:11.030
who tries to hurt these animals.

125
00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.290
The only reason anyone ever
comes to this island

126
00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:15.390
is to take
these precious animals.

127
00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:19.750
[BUGGY]
Ugh. Why would I care
about some stupid animals?

128
00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:20.820
[GAIMON]
Huh?

129
00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:24.190
So... then you're not a poacher?

130
00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:38.200
So what'd you think?

131
00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:40.960
It's some pretty good sake
if I don't say so myself.

132
00:07:40.990 --> 00:07:43.160
[BUGGY]
Ooh, it's the best.

133
00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:46.410
It's been awhile
since I've had a good drink.

134
00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:48.180
[GAIMON]
Have as much as you'd like.

135
00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:50.080
I can always make more.

136
00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:53.200
I'm sorry about that
misunderstanding earlier.

137
00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.660
Don't worry.
All of that's behind us now.

138
00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:57.670
No need to mention it again.

139
00:07:57.670 --> 00:07:59.300
[GAIMON, BUGGY]
– Cheers!
– Cheers!

140
00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:05.070
[GAIMON, BUGGY laughing]

141
00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.950
[BUGGY]
Thanks for helping me
rebuild my flashy raft.

142
00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:14.420
[GAIMON]
No problem, my friend.

143
00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:17.020
I like working with my hands.

144
00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:20.010
We'll meet again someday.

145
00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:21.890
[GAIMON]
I'd like that.

146
00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:25.600
[BUGGY sniffs]

147
00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:30.800
[GAIMON sniffs, sobs]

148
00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.680
Goodbye... my friend.

149
00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:38.960
Take care of yourself!

150
00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:44.860
[BUGGY]
Goodbye!

151
00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:50.040
[BUGGY]
Set sail!

152
00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.740
Ha haaa!

153
00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:57.840
[GAIMON]
Buggy...

154
00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:03.680
I'm sorry I forgot to
warn you about the monsters.

155
00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:07.710
But I know you'll be okay.

156
00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:14.100
No, go the other way!

157
00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:17.540
[BUGGY yells]

158
00:09:19.340 --> 00:09:21.440
[screams]

159
00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:23.240
Oh, that's just great.

160
00:09:23.270 --> 00:09:26.400
Swim! Go Buggy!

161
00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:28.000
[BUGGY screams]

162
00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:32.670
Hey... Get outta there!
He looks hungry!

163
00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:36.640
[GAIMON]
Huh?

164
00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:38.200
What's that?

165
00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:46.570
[screams]

166
00:09:56.120 --> 00:10:00.870
<b>A Mysterious Woman</b>

167
00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.940
[BUGGY]
Oh, she's hot.

168
00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:05.630
Wait for me!

169
00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:08.760
I haven't seen a woman
in over twenty years.

170
00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:11.380
Well... that's a
pirate's luck for ya

171
00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:12.910
if I've ever seen it.

172
00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:16.000
And to think
I was worried about him.

173
00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:18.540
[chuckles]

174
00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:23.280
Have a good time,
you lucky bastard!

175
00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:28.840
Thanks. I owe you one.

176
00:10:30.290 --> 00:10:31.930
I thought I was
a goner for sure.

177
00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:34.560
It's really no big deal.

178
00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:37.810
Buggy...
the Pirate Clown, right?

179
00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:41.790
What's it to you?
Just who are you, lady?

180
00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:44.960
I'm looking for
a certain young pirate.

181
00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:46.960
I think you know him.

182
00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:50.700
[yells]
That's him! Stupid brat.

183
00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:52.930
Just wait till
I get my hands on you.

184
00:10:53.060 --> 00:10:54.960
You're dead!

185
00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:59.350
Hmm? Is that the guy
you're looking for?

186
00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:02.470
[BUGGY]
I see. Now I understand.

187
00:11:03.340 --> 00:11:05.610
So that's why you saved my life.

188
00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:09.290
So then... What'd ya say?

189
00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:15.020
Hell yes. We both want to kill

190
00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:18.190
the same stupid kid,
so we should work together.

191
00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:21.270
That's great. Let's drink on it.

192
00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:22.690
[BUGGY]
Cheers.

193
00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:25.360
- [BUGGY laughs]
- [ALVIDA chuckles]

194
00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:34.900
[PIRATE D]
Captain Buggy!

195
00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:38.000
[sobbing]

196
00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:40.240
[PIRATE B]
Before he died,
I hated Captain Buggy.

197
00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:42.700
I always thought he was
cruel and heartless.

198
00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.570
But now I see
how hard he worked.

199
00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:47.880
He really just wanted
what was best for his crew.

200
00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:49.840
With Captain Buggy
we were able to

201
00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:51.610
pillage and plunder
to our hearts content.

202
00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:55.610
I don't know if it'll be
the same with another captain.

203
00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:57.450
Let's honor our missing leader.

204
00:11:57.510 --> 00:12:00.550
He deserves a flashy
goodbye from us.

205
00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:01.920
[MOHJI, RICHIE sobbing]

206
00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:05.390
[CABAJI]
Rest in peace... captain.

207
00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:08.620
Leave it to me.
Your faithful number two.

208
00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:12.340
Cabaji the Acrobat
is ready to take your place.

209
00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:14.270
[MOHJI]
Hmm?

210
00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:15.340
[CABAJI]
I will take the helm and lead

211
00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:17.790
the Buggy Pirates
back on the path to glory.

212
00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.720
[MOHJI]
Stop right there!

213
00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:22.110
Cabaji!

214
00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:23.960
It is I, Beast Tamer Mohji,

215
00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:25.400
the captain's
right hand man who should

216
00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:27.900
take his proper place
as our leader.

217
00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:29.370
I've always been
the next in line

218
00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:32.370
and nobody is going
to take that away from me.

219
00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:35.370
I'll be glad to take you
as my second in command,

220
00:12:35.370 --> 00:12:38.550
Heh. All right then,
looks like we'll have a fight

221
00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:40.650
to see who'll be
the next captain!

222
00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:41.380
[PIRATES]
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

223
00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:42.880
That's just fine by me.

224
00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:45.070
[PIRATES chuckle]

225
00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:53.200
[PIRATES chanting]
– Mohji! Mohji! Mohji!
– Mohji! Mohji! Mohji!

226
00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.960
<b>"Beast Tamer" Mohji
First Mate of the Buggy Pirates</b>

227
00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.760
[PIRATES chanting]
– Cabaji! Cabaji! Cabaji!
– Cabaji! Cabaji! Cabaji!

228
00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:56.630
<b>Cabaji "the Acrobat"
First Officer of the Buggy Pirates</b>

229
00:12:56.760 --> 00:12:58.540
[PIRATES chanting]
– Mohji! Mohji!
– Mohji! Mohji!

230
00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.340
Cabaji! Cabaji!

231
00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:02.380
Mohji! Mohji!

232
00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:04.470
Cabaji! Cabaji!

233
00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:07.310
Mohji! Mohji!

234
00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:26.450
[CABAJI]
I guess we'll settle
this the old-fashioned way.

235
00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.120
Hand to hand combat.

236
00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:30.450
And I wouldn't have
it any other way.

237
00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:33.160
Now I get to tear you
apart limb from limb.

238
00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:44.890
<b>Twelve Hours
Since the Battle Started</b>

239
00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:48.260
[muffled]
It's no use. Just give up.

240
00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:50.830
You know... you can't
take it... anymore.

241
00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:54.260
[muffled]
I didn't understand
anything you just said.

242
00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:22.090
[BOTH]
– Richie! The greatest captain ever!
– Richie! The greatest captain ever!

243
00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:53.470
[PIRATES]
– Captain Richie! Captain Richie!
– Captain Richie! Captain Richie!

244
00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.770
He's the Greatest!

245
00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.370
[PIRATE D]
After the loss of Captain Buggy,

246
00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:58.010
Richie is the one
who will lead us now!

247
00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.480
All hail Captain Richie!

248
00:15:00.480 --> 00:15:15.320
[PIRATES continue chanting]

249
00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:14.560
<b>Richie
Captain of the Richie Pirates</b>

250
00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:17.960
[PIRATES chant]
– He's the greatest! He's a lion!
– He's the greatest! He's a lion!

251
00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:24.000
Captain Richie! Captain Richie!
He's the greatest! He's a lion!

252
00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:31.210
[PIRATES cheer]

253
00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:42.180
You are trespassing.

254
00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:44.080
This island belongs
to the Bear Claw Tribe

255
00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.880
and you will be shown no mercy.

256
00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.160
Help, captain!

257
00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:55.830
[BEAR CLAW A]
Then we shall
fight to the death.

258
00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:16.010
We surrender.

259
00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.730
Did you find something?

260
00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:26.900
Look. That's my ship!

261
00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:31.540
The Grand Flashy Flagship
of the Buggy Pirates!

262
00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:34.100
[BUGGY]
But who would do this?

263
00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:36.700
Who would use
such an old picture?

264
00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:40.470
[sighs]
And what did they bury?

265
00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:44.440
Hey. There's somebody passed out
on the ground over there.

266
00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.080
[BUGGY]
No!

267
00:16:46.630 --> 00:16:48.610
Mohji! Cabaji?

268
00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.820
What the hell
happened to you two?

269
00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:54.980
Cap-Captain Buggy...!

270
00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:58.890
[gasps]
You're alive!

271
00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:01.710
Never leave us again!

272
00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:05.050
[CABAJI]
We thought
you were gone forever!

273
00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:08.380
I missed you guys so much!

274
00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:13.050
So... uh...
Who kicked your asses?

275
00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:15.660
I'd like to say hello!

276
00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.430
Uh...
I don't remember anything

277
00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:20.760
except getting knocked out.

278
00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:25.600
We were attacked.
But I have no idea who did it.

279
00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.640
[ALVIDA]
Looks like your boys
have been introduced

280
00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:29.290
to the Bear Claw Tribe.

281
00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:33.470
Yeah. We better hurry up
if you want to save your crew.

282
00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:34.780
[ALL shriek]

283
00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:37.450
The Bear Claws are cannibals.

284
00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:51.240
[PIRATES, RICHIE yell]

285
00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:54.450
Took a crap in the pot.
You can't eat us now.

286
00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:56.120
And I peed myself.

287
00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.960
We'd all be dry
and stringy anyway.

288
00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:00.970
Just eat this guy.
He looks tasty.

289
00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:03.810
He's got much more meat on
his bones than I do. Eat him!

290
00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:07.120
This isn't happening.
This isn't happening!

291
00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:11.400
Don't worry.
It'll all be over soon.

292
00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.900
We're the Bear Claw Tribe.

293
00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:15.900
We know how to prepare anyone
to taste quite delicious!

294
00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:18.640
[PIRATES holler]

295
00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:22.510
What are we gonna do
with these things?

296
00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:23.670
Appetizers?

297
00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:26.410
I'm not so sure those chunks
would be very good to eat.

298
00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:27.810
[BEAR CLAW D]
Give them to the dog.

299
00:18:27.850 --> 00:18:29.380
[sniffs]
No way.

300
00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:31.250
I think it might
make him throw up.

301
00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:33.520
[BUGGY]
Chop, chop...

302
00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.360
[BEAR CLAWS gasp]

303
00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:39.690
[BUGGY]
Chop, chop, chop, chop...

304
00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:08.100
[gasps]
It can't be!

305
00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:12.910
chop-chop, chop-chop,
Flashy Reassemble!

306
00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:26.480
[BUGGY laughs]

307
00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:44.840
I'm back!

308
00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:45.370
<b>Buggy "the Clown"
Captain of the Buggy Pirates</b>

309
00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:50.360
[PIRATE holler, cheer]

310
00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:54.030
And now...
my favorite! Showtime!

311
00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:57.630
Super Flashy Buggy Ball!

312
00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.870
[laughs]

313
00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:04.050
[BEAR CLAWS yell]

314
00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:09.110
[whistles]

315
00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:11.620
[MOHJI]
Richie!

316
00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:14.120
[roars]

317
00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.360
[CABAJI]
Acrobat Technique:

318
00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:22.790
Extreme Wrath at the Steam Bath!

319
00:20:23.190 --> 00:20:28.070
It's time for
the Beast Tamer Mohji!

320
00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:30.560
[RICHIE roars]

321
00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:32.560
[BUGGY laughs]

322
00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:35.000
I'm Captain Buggy
the Clown Pirate!

323
00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.840
You didn't really think you'd
be able to hurt me, did you?

324
00:20:37.840 --> 00:20:39.740
[BEAR CLAWS gasp]

325
00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:41.480
Your tribe has done
such a good job

326
00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:44.920
looking after my men.
Let me give you your reward.

327
00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:46.850
Here I come, boys!

328
00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:48.610
[laughs]

329
00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:50.780
Chop-Chop Kick!

330
00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:55.820
[BEAR CLAW D, E groan]

331
00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:59.600
Aah! Chop-Chop... Punch!

332
00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:02.320
Try to eat us now!

333
00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:06.580
[chuckles]

334
00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:13.180
[PIRATES cheer]

335
00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:16.470
Thank you. You saved us.

336
00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:18.380
My adorable little children.

337
00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:20.810
I've missed you all
so very much.

338
00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:22.480
Where have you been
captain, sir?

339
00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:25.620
Please tell us what
happened to you at sea!

340
00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:33.540
That damn Straw Hat
is the reason for all of this.

341
00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:37.350
I promise that
I will make him pay!

342
00:21:37.590 --> 00:21:42.030
[PIRATE B]
Uh... Captain Buggy,
sir... Who's the pretty lady?

343
00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:44.570
This is the woman
who saved my life

344
00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.040
and her name is...

345
00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:48.370
Hold on...

346
00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:50.780
I don't know her name.

347
00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:53.210
Sorry, what was your name again?

348
00:21:54.950 --> 00:22:00.050
[CABAJI]
All right! The Buggy
Pirates are back together!

349
00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:04.820
So captain, what orders
do you have for us?

350
00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:10.930
To find and kill
Monkey D. Luffy!

351
00:22:26.760 --> 00:22:31.750
More feelings than I can hold but I can’t make you understand

352
00:22:31.770 --> 00:22:36.610
Be that as it may, I just can’t bear to let go of your hand

353
00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:41.560
I’ve still gotta move, even if I’m alone I’ll walk along

354
00:22:41.600 --> 00:22:46.830
Just promise that you’ll still keep an eye on me when I am gone Just promise that you’ll still keep an eye on me when I am gone

355
00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:56.360
As soon as I woke up, couldn’t get it off my mind

356
00:22:56.410 --> 00:23:01.110
“Why the hell’s it so hot? I can hardly breathe!”

357
00:23:01.110 --> 00:23:07.620
It’s been quite a while, but those thoughts just won’t seem to let go It’s been quite a while, but those thoughts just won’t seem to let go

358
00:23:07.620 --> 00:23:11.500
But hey, what do I know?

359
00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:17.370
Guess I want a taste of that thing people call a “runner’s high”

360
00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:22.240
Think I chased too hard, and ended up leaving myself behind

361
00:23:22.290 --> 00:23:27.230
All I want’s a taste of a dream that a sentence can’t define

362
00:23:27.230 --> 00:23:32.420
Stick right by my side, and I can run, run, run until I die
